<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16737" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσύγκρῐτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not comparable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				89.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>D.</u>
				1.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.64
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ἄλλοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Marc.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσύγκριτος ἄνθρωπος ἀλόγῳ ζῴῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>D.</u>
					1.11
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				<i>without the use of the comparative form,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.T.
					635.15
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>incomparable, surpassing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.578
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Dio</u>
				47
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				613.20
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, etc., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ath.Mitt.</u>
				12.174
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Prusias</span>); of remedies, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.112
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				<i>incomparably,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hierocl.
					<u>in CA</u>
					3p.424M.
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				3493.14
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Thyatira</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>antagonistic, of alien kind,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.134d
			</span></i> (but v. foreg.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
